msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫.................."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5AD2E860_A5D1_4D0E_A441_21ED1B447000
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d90d8548f3dee2d9edf325db74b9a882fc9c02865ec0b8cd37d20f4178874701
#. default-sha256: 3c71a8a92df38d5792097f3734d6617d5aa7c0d8547253b845e24d34326e025a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5AD2E860_A5D1_4D0E_A441_21ED1B447000"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man is still straddling me, dagger held above his head,⟪k:1⟫just as he had been before "
"our trek into his past.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His eyes are open wide, and his hand is trembling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’homme me domine toujours, sa dague levée au-dessus de sa tête,⟪k:1⟫exactement dans la "
"position où il était juste avant notre excursion dans le passé.⟪k:2⟫ Ses yeux sont grand ouverts "
"et sa main tremble."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4273DA75_2931_4D97_AFAC_4206E24832A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 124856398f740bd9ecf2af54597a91c046ee9bd1d69af62eee6fcffcece3876c
#. default-sha256: a267816d5b876265e34713769a4465ece0fcce75ba5e8733900c43a12e517e68
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4273DA75_2931_4D97_AFAC_4206E24832A0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A few moments later, his fingers go slack, and the blade slips from his grasp, piercing the "
"wood floor by my face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’instant d’après, ses doigts se relâchent et la lame, libérée de leur emprise, tombe au "
"sol, perçant le plancher en bois, manquant de peu mon visage."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9CA830CD_1A7F_4811_B255_6755AF204D05
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63b6f23efd1f6a897a89bb5e816467d3444dab6b40d147dc70126a5b43388798
